{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>What is it?</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A classic 2D platformer with unique features that add complexity and variety to the gameplay. Master the controls to overcome traps and enemies. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Explore diverse locations</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265510/extras/3e9c8cfe5885d5991a647248d2dad825.avif?t=1772120210\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265510/extras_big/3e9c8cfe5885d5991a647248d2dad825.avif?t=1772120210 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Nocky's journey will take you through savannas, deserts, caves, the sea, and even the sky. Each area is unique and more dangerous than the last!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>The beginning</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">New icon of 2D platforms that will try to fight to gain a space in the hearts of lovers of the genre! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join him on his fascinating adventure and celebrate his birth together! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Argument</u></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A tragic event, carried out by a group of poachers, shakes the calm life of our emblematic protagonist that will lead him to travel through African lands in search of revenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <u><strong>Remembering</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Nocky el Armadillo seeks to bring back the epic adventures we live on 16-bit consoles, becoming the new star that conquers 